   "widgets_values": [
    "CC Sepia Map Mark T2I\nLibrary 6.9 map symbols (D-): monochrome sepia hand-drawn map vignettes on PURE WHITE,\nfor the world map. Style core STYLE_CORE_map_sepia.txt + NEGATIVE_map_sepia.txt (the\ndefault negative bans sepia and aged paper, so it cannot be used here) + [C-MAPMARK].\nThe white ground is not decoration: CC Post Sepia Alpha keys transparency off it.\nBulk: python3 assets/flux/generate.py --chapter D --style-file STYLE_CORE_map_sepia.txt\nPrompt = a STYLE_CORE file + subject + [C-...] canvas, never typed by hand."
